{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin! What\u2019s up? Last Friday I went to the car show. I saw some awesome cars and got to mess with car mods! There were so many cool machines around, it was so much fun! Take a look at this beautiful car!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-fda35f6d069e926c2d563863", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.689987+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fda35f6d069e926c2d563863", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fda35f6d069e926c2d563863", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave, that sounds awesome! I'm into the rush of awesome cars. Can't wait to check out your garage."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-20fe3a22064de85c635aa611", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.714026+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "20fe3a22064de85c635aa611", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "20fe3a22064de85c635aa611", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks! Yeah, this one looks great! I restored and modified it myself and added a custom exhaust and some performance upgrades. It's got a sweet sound and I'm really proud of how it turned out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-dd617438a673164f36305cc6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.727430+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dd617438a673164f36305cc6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dd617438a673164f36305cc6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, Dave! You really turned it into a masterpiece. Impressive!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-656e80c34be77d233c15f28c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.741159+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "656e80c34be77d233c15f28c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "656e80c34be77d233c15f28c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks Calvin! I've spent a lot of time and effort on it. It's not just a hobby, it's a passion. It's like therapy, a way to get away from everyday stress. When I was little I'd spend hours in my dad's garage, tinkering with engines - it was like my own sanctuary. Now I'm lucky enough to do this as a job, to take something broken and make it into something awesome."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-1cda6c838f5ed30ea8386a27", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.752863+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1cda6c838f5ed30ea8386a27", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1cda6c838f5ed30ea8386a27", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, Dave, that's amazing. Bringing broken things back to life is so satisfying. Working on cars can be a real escape from reality, and I understand that feeling. Doing what you love for a living, that's the ultimate goal, right? Keep going with it, it's really inspiring."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-6537e5c546897cf4ae691d01", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.772901+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6537e5c546897cf4ae691d01", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6537e5c546897cf4ae691d01", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin. It's been my goal since I was a kid and it's awesome to be able to do something I love. Restoring things like this can be tough but the feeling of accomplishment it gives is great. Absolutely, I'm loving it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-71895c721c57963a36318ae0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.788506+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "71895c721c57963a36318ae0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "71895c721c57963a36318ae0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Go for it, Dave! Chasing your dreams is what life's about. It's awesome to see how far you've come. Keep working hard and living your best life."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-688e930570b07df3edb2b7f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.803506+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "688e930570b07df3edb2b7f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "688e930570b07df3edb2b7f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Means a lot. I'm going to keep chasing my dreams and working hard. Conversations like this remind me why I love what I do."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-4cb0e0574306d37180a97cfe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.819483+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4cb0e0574306d37180a97cfe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4cb0e0574306d37180a97cfe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Glad I can remind you, Dave. Keep up the good work and stay focused. You got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-6a6ed1741c1d19a19f87449b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.828886+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6a6ed1741c1d19a19f87449b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6a6ed1741c1d19a19f87449b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Your support really means a lot. I'll stay focused and keep going. Appreciate the encouragement!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-62cfef750828d5f95e0d17e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.842770+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "62cfef750828d5f95e0d17e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "62cfef750828d5f95e0d17e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah Dave! I'll always be here to support you and give you that boost. You're doing great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-3ad6810feec801fcb4e228ad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.854984+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3ad6810feec801fcb4e228ad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3ad6810feec801fcb4e228ad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks so much, Calvin. Your support means everything to me. I'll keep pushing and reaching for them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-295185f55e17ae37452db260", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.868165+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "295185f55e17ae37452db260", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "295185f55e17ae37452db260", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: No worries, Dave. Keep going for it. You got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_22-aea89e2b08e2915d6f523b1d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:06:52.880478+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aea89e2b08e2915d6f523b1d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aea89e2b08e2915d6f523b1d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
